{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for making time for this meeting. As you know, a student is scheduled to return to school next Monday after completing a three-day suspension following the cafeteria altercation. Before I can approve a return-to-school behavior plan, our re-entry policy requires me to gather current implementation information from each of you across three areas: classroom, counseling, and family-support. I'd like to go around and hear from each of you so we can build a plan that properly addresses supervision during unstructured periods, daily check-ins, extracurricular participation, and communication with the student's caregiver. Who would like to start?"}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I'd like to share what I've observed. During two recent classroom transitions, I noticed that the student de-escalated successfully when an adult remained at the student's lunch table. Based on that, I recommend an assigned-adult lunch table and a 30-minute morning check-in for the first five school days. I recorded this in my working notes but haven't yet entered it in the behavior system."}
```

